  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "Plugin Preflight for DSH",
      "text": "> A small static preflight for DSH plugin packages. It catches the mistakes that make a bundle fail\n> review: missing bundle patch, lifecycle scripts, stray logs/binaries, broken skill frontmatter."
    },
    {
      "section": "Use",
      "text": "```bash\nnode bin/dsh-preflight.mjs /path/to/plugin\nnode bin/dsh-preflight.mjs /path/to/plugin --json\nnode bin/dsh-preflight.mjs --tarball /path/to/package.tgz\n```\n\nThe tarball mode checks the actual `npm pack` output: required files, bundle patch, lifecycle\nscripts, unsupported entries, and `test/`/`dist/` residue.\n\nIn DSH:\n\n```text\nUse plugin_preflight on /path/to/plugin.\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "Scope",
      "text": "- Static package surface only\n- No install, boot, runtime, signature, or security test\n- A PASS is not a safety certificate"
    },
    {
      "section": "Tests",
      "text": "```bash\nnpm test\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "Provenance",
      "text": "Inspired by DSH-Store's static precheck; this is an independent small implementation. No store source\ncode is copied. License: MIT."
    }
  ],
